{'symbol': 'KEYS', 'date': '2023-02-16 11:00:00', 'title': 'KEYSIGHT SELECTED BY DSP RESEARCH TO DELIVER RADIO FREQUENCY REGULATORY CERTIFICATION OF 5G DEVICES', 'text': "SANTA ROSA, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $KEYS #5G--KEYSIGHT TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (NYSE: KEYS), A LEADING TECHNOLOGY COMPANY THAT DELIVERS ADVANCED DESIGN AND VALIDATION SOLUTIONS TO HELP ACCELERATE INNOVATION TO CONNECT AND SECURE THE WORLD, ANNOUNCED THAT DSP RESEARCH, A CERTIFICATION AND TEST LABORATORY, RECENTLY SELECTED KEYSIGHT'S 5G DEVICE TEST SOLUTIONS TO DELIVER RADIO FREQUENCY (RF) REGULATORY CERTIFICATION SERVICES IN JAPAN."}